{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>TVB重頭劇《玫瑰戰爭》爆發激烈爭鬥，41歲傅嘉莉為愛走火入魔瘋狂掌摑陳自瑤。兩女在戲中因爭奪馬國明引發連環報復，一場精心策劃大騙局更令無辜受害者事業盡毀。這場夾雜私怨與利益算計背後隱藏着令人心寒報復手段。</p>\n<h2>《玫瑰戰爭》傅嘉莉為奪愛連環掌摑陳自瑤</h2>\n<p>劇中傅嘉莉飾演暗戀馬國明多年心機女梁菲雅，因眼紅陳自瑤飾演影后關子盈與男方秘密相戀，妒火中燒下將對方視為頭號情敵。在一場戲中戲拍攝期間，梁菲雅借機假戲真做，對關子盈狠下毒手進行連環掌摑。其後她更聯同莫家淦飾演關子盈舊同學志邦設下毒計，無中生有誣衊關子盈勾搭有婦之夫，連串陰險毒辣操作最終令這位影后演藝事業面臨全面崩盤重創。</p>\n<h2>傅嘉莉曾被貼拜金標籤 親揭年長男伴真正身份</h2>\n<p>現實中傅嘉莉曾多次被外界貼上拜金與釣金龜標籤，更被傳媒拍到與年長男士逛街並有名車接送出入。面對種種負面傳聞，她事後大方澄清該名男士僅為來自新加坡好友，自己當天純粹盡地主之誼陪伴對方。她以極高EQ親自回應外界對其私生活揣測，霸氣強調「社交圈子廣泛，擁有不同年齡層、身份、婚姻狀態、身形及國籍的朋友」，坦蕩率直展現真實性格。</p>\n<h2>憑《反黑英雄》奪萬千星輝最佳女配角</h2>\n<p>這位41歲中德混血兒出道初期曾被封為翻版徐子淇，近年早已擺脫花瓶形象晉身實力派女演員行列。她於萬千星輝頒獎典禮2024憑藉《反黑英雄》細膩演出勇奪最佳女配角殊榮，演技備受肯定。除了演藝事業穩步上揚，她近年一邊拍劇一邊攻讀香港都會大學寶石及珠寶學應用理學士學位，並成功考獲英國寶石學會鑑定師文憑，展現出美貌與智慧並重一面。</p>\n<h2>網民大讚《玫瑰戰爭》反派角色極具張力</h2>\n<p>隨著《玫瑰戰爭》劇情逐步推向高潮，大批觀眾對這場娛樂圈女星明爭暗鬥看得相當投入。不少人在討論區熱烈留言討論，紛紛大讚傅嘉莉這次演繹惡女角色入木三分，留言表示「反派演技令人眼前一亮」、「睇到想衝入電視打佢」。同時亦有觀眾十分同情劇中受害者處境，直指「陳自瑤今次真係好慘」，目前相關討論帖文仍在各大社交平台持續增加。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179447189405754163_13225647476af577d67f298.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"photo_6316776275778933985_y.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179447189405754163_13225647476af577d67f298.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>傅嘉莉戲中借拍戲之名向情敵陳自瑤連環掌摑，公報私仇！（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17944718955077924_8206476406af577d822db5.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"photo_6316776275778933983_y.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17944718955077924_8206476406af577d822db5.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179440576754791551_142667126af4758893a3a.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"玫瑰戰爭 陳自瑤 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179440576754791551_142667126af4758893a3a.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179440577245451457_4042400526af4758cc8c43.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"玫瑰戰爭 陳自瑤 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179440577245451457_4042400526af4758cc8c43.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179447189740172196_11018203626af577d9b9217.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"玫瑰戰爭第4集劇情｜陳自瑤慘被冤枉狂摑30巴 姐妹變淫媒聯手灌迷姦水！/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179447189740172196_11018203626af577d9b9217.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>傅嘉莉飾演的梁菲雅暗戀馬國明多年，得悉對方心有所屬後妒火中燒。（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/10_9835728176af2bad6cf200.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/10_9835728176af2bad6cf200.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>傅嘉莉今次化身心機女梁菲雅（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/13_4608797936af2bae120941.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/13_4608797936af2bae120941.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/41_8704455566a7eb02fb69b5.jpeg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"夫妻的博弈 傅嘉莉 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/41_8704455566a7eb02fb69b5.jpeg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>近年獲TVB力捧（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/176957038033032152_21332365436979804c98d44.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"傅嘉莉 進修課程 傅嘉莉曬4本厚書興奮開學（圖片來源：IG@kelly.fuu）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/176957038033032152_21332365436979804c98d44.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>傅嘉莉攻讀寶石及珠寶學相關學位，更考獲英國寶石學會鑑定師文憑。（圖片來源：IG@kelly.fuu）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/8f0d9746-611b-41d3-b257-7e91008df20d_40841151968a69c558a583.jpeg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"傅嘉莉 進修課程 傅嘉莉憑《反黑英雄》奪得她入行以來首個「最佳女配角」獎座（圖片來源：IG@kelly.fuu）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/8f0d9746-611b-41d3-b257-7e91008df20d_40841151968a69c558a583.jpeg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>傅嘉莉憑《反黑英雄》奪得她入行以來首個「最佳女配角」獎座（圖片來源：IG@kelly.fuu）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T14:03:55.855851+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1302,"images":10,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T13:30:05+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T14:17:30.193879+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T13:57:29.095207+00:00","content_hash":"aa6d011b4396c99f0c81e250d3dbbc897065c2bc988f338452c02f01671dd7fb","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}